   "date": "2018-02-20T09:12:34Z",
   "subject": "RE: [geomorph-r-package] change warp mesh colour from black",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_-5801449905975499611__MailEndCompose\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Hi Christy,<u></u><u></u></span></a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">After reading in a reference ply file, one has the ability to change the color component. It is found in the $material\r\n part of the ply object in R.  Try something like<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Myply$material &lt;- “gray”\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">and then continue the remaining downstream operations. The help page ?read.ply describes this process.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAdditional information found in the help file of WarpRefMesh.<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Best,\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dean<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Director of Graduate Education, EEB Program<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">       Department of Statistics<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span></span><a href=\"http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485853654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2a6dsCaCV6KQtVErJQC5vQ\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:purple\">www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/</span></span><span></span></a><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a><u></u><u></u></span></span></p></div></div>"
